OL,3,GNEWSADUP MP Jim Shannon charged with
OL,4,Acommon assault of a woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) MP
OL,7,FJim Shannon has been charged with
OL,8,Fcommon assault of a woman.
OL,10,FIt is alleged to have happened on 1
OL,11,FOctober 2023.
OL,13,FIn a statement, his solicitors said
OL,14,Fthat the case was being "factually
OL,15,Fcontested".
OL,17,FShannon, 71, with an address at DUP
OL,18,Foffices on Frances Street in
OL,19,FNewtownards, did not attend Newtownards
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
